<title>SWEDEN: Average yield at Swedish 5-yr bond auction 5.72 pc.</title>
<headline>Average yield at Swedish 5-yr bond auction 5.72 pc.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield at an auction of two billion crowns worth of five-year Swedish government bonds was 5.72 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				   Bond number 1039</p>
<p> Volume issued (billion Skr)	    2.0</p>
<p> Total bids (billion Skr)		 4.3</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		   16</p>
<p> Number of bids				43</p>
<p> Lowest rate				  5.708</p>
<p> Highest accepted rate		    5.724</p>
<p> Weighted average rate		    5.717</p>
<p> Percent served at highest rate	47.06</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
